Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could this guy possibly need\Nfrom me? I've had a big stupid day and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just want to go home So what exactly\Nis it you want me to do with you? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sparring session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.35,0:00:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so a mock battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've had a training\Npartner since I was attending the schools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have guessed but\NI'm a big thing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to choose\Nwhatever weapon you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see what our new big\Nthing is truly capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.53,0:00:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a godsend!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For an up-and-coming adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.89,0:00:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asa yaka ni ahog somari
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:01:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How not to do the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.85,0:01:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kodok wo seou ta la.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ukande kuru musion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiru ga esu. Yoj sae mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na ni wo mii tsuketakute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Na ni wo kukamitakute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you back, but\NI'm not going to take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to return,\NI can't get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.59,0:01:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much of a challenge\NI'll be for a legend like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it is a good chance for\Nme to learn some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sparring session with Captain Gilbert?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who even is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope he enjoys the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such polished movement and the way\Nhe controls his pace is made art.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have trained incessantly\Nto get himself to this level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is he so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With me as his opponent, there's no point\Nin showing any clues of what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.49,0:03:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time out, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking it easy on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but don't feel you have to\Nhold back quite so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.23,0:03:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have something after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, much faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, more importantly, the moment I evade\Nhim, he leaves himself completely open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's luring me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can I not make contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's really fighting yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see you dodge this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He changed it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to toy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and\Nspeed up your attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.85,0:04:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he already giving it all he's got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did all my years of\Ntraining and training...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it actually amount to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe, maybe I might be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drag wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.05,0:05:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's my loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could anyone evade\Nthe captain's regrave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was using a practice spear with a wider\Ntip so the wind force sends a guy flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it had been a battle spear\Nhe would have lost his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People with talent like captain\Ngilbert are one in a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I had a gift for this the\Nmoment I held a spear in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winner is Sir Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the guy you were talking\Nabout in the Royal Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The difference in their\Npower is clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one in the village\Nthat can beat that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more I trained, the more polished my\Ntechnique became, and the stronger I grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy yourself\Nhere in our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was fine, although painfully boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand you traveled to various areas\Nsearching for the strongest opponents,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I doubt there's\Nanyone around these parts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who can possibly match\Nyou spear for spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've defeated every worthy opponent\Nin the entire royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I set out with hopes that\NI could find someone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the latest rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the balance of power between the kingdom\Nand their neighbors is falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are calling for more troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and people will be gathering\Nin search of fame and fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you can find\Nsomeone in their ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to the capital while\Nthey assemble new warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I returned to the royal capital and\Nobsessively continued hunting down demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:06:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whenever I heard someone\Nformidable join the core,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I challenged them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thoroughly trounced them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just isn't doing it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there no one to give\Nme a real challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every fiber of my being is bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am surrounded by such weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, you're looking glum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For someone bestowed\Nsuch an honorable alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Spear Sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just another cumbersome,\Nobvious title thrust upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's rather rude of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize a title equal\Nto my own rank was a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.81,0:07:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long can I keep\Nclobbering mindless dolts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about sparring with Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spar with Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:08:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, she's strong in her own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter her approach,\NI'd win every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can there not be more competent\Ncompetitors like you, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit that does sound entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must be losing it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Training soldiers and adventurers who have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about as much talent as your pinky finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job is to protect the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't win a war by myself,\Nno matter how skilled I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, at some point, someone\Nwill appear and surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they show up while I'm\Nstill able to walk around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't throw myself off a cliff first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man defeats a minotaur,\Nbasically by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to see what that\Nperson was all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He showed not an ounce of interest\Nin the most lavish of rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while an audience with\Nthe king, ugh, so uncouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his fight was impressive, of course.\NHowever, it never felt like he had the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power to kill a beast\Nof that size and yet he
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did why can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i not make contact
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't have to toy with\Nme you can go ahead and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,speed up your attacks\NCareful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.47,0:09:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did ask for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I went at him full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My most powerful technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even faster than the speed of sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I knew letting something like that\Nloose on a normal person, they would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in that moment, I had\Nto reach him with my spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drag wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first time in a head-to-head\Nbattle, I was soundly defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And furthermore, very well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's my loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say? I get it. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point for us to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he showing me pity because we\Nwere in front of my subordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had been humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just what is it you get? Yeah, let's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call it you were great and then there
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were his parting words see ya I look\Nforward to playing with you again sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened\Nto the floor? Did we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just do that I haven't\Na clue how he did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He evaded everything even my\Nfavorite technique at full strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like things are finally\Ngonna get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that guy had an incredible attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I doing thinking I was\Nbecoming some hidden super adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had already used both physical\Nenhancement and featherstep to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't held back for a\Nmoment so I could run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even warned me about pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically told me what he'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's something else, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greg?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gerb?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or Berg, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bird? Or Richard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever his name is, I am in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have so much more to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is perfect for scraping out muck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it even gets the really stubborn,\Nsticky stuff stuck on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may be the best sword ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he made quick work of that. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does such a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Lin's dad said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.37,0:12:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if you're a little rough\Nwith it, it won't get a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's already so\Ndinged up at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could really tell if it\Ngot a few more scratches?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you take care of my drain next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great that my drain\Nclearing job is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but because of the big demon incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had to stop my dirt\Nhauling job for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I can only take F-rank jobs,\Nwhen work in the royal capital dries up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there'll be entire days\Nwhere I have nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've got this great new tool, I\Nmay as well use it to try to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use this as an oar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'd have to buy a boat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it costs money to buy an oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I have the space for\Nit, I can use it as a griddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But well, the problem is the firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tiny flame with my abilities the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,best i can do is light a flicker at\Nthe end of my fingertip i trained
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i trained and trained at those schools\Nand all i could get was a faint
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little glimpse of any skill, huh
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hello lord north good morning to you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not permitted to take\Non such a familiar manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Berg, me most noble lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just call me Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone tell you to\Nbe formal with me? Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for just showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went to the guild master\Nand asked where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think I ever\Nsaid my exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of her thief skills is\Nfinding out where things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what brings you out here to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, I have a request to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just. I want you to\Naccept me as your loyal page.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's that supposed to be? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a page is someone who takes care\Nof your everyday necessities
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as they learn new techniques\Nand absorb knowledge from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to say, it's close to an\Nassistant or having an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just allowing me to be\Naround you will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will cause you no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you would please be\Nso kind as to please...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:14:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, was there something you were\Nunhappy with from the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you think that maybe someone\Nas young as me would be too unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you give me permission to stay, I'm\Nsure it can be a tremendous help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to brag,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I earned the highest achievements in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,history from the six\Nroyal capital trains...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lin, there is nothing at all that I can\Nteach you that you haven't already learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I really don't need\Nanybody's help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do what I need all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then my family will pay you a very\Nhandsome instructor's fee. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, you can use me\Nto do whatever you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an assistant for requests from the\NAdventurers Guild or for odd jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't need you to do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, let me show you that\NI can be of help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this will make you believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Icicle dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of the highest levels\Nof magic skills that I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is called Hellflare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Mistblade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the secret of the Thief Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sovereign of Shadows\Nimparted this knowledge unto me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the sacred class skill\Nof a swordsman, the Divine Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a specialized technique\Nused against the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and also... I get it. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then do I have permission to\Nbecome your personal page?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.69,0:17:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's somehow mistaken me for\Nsomebody who's worth learning from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everything she just showed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like a grade\Nschooler compared to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of obvious there's\Nnothing I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power has been recognized by the six\Nsovereigns, And if you let me join you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can assist you\Nin some meaningful way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still think I'm nothing impressive\Ncompared to the likes of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I could still learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just doesn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just show her the sad truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you showed me the amazing skills you've\Nmanaged to acquire through your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:17:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now see the extent of my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The young boy with no talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throughout the years, the\Ninstructors at the Royal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capitals training schools would\Ntell stories of this young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, everyone interpreted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them as fairy tales\Ncreated to teach lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the idea of that young boy was\Npreposterous, borderline ludicrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a mere 12-year-old,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he attended all six training\Ncourses known for their
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,daunting and rigorous\Nnature at the royal schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he completed the full term for each.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody like that cannot possibly exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.03,0:18:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the toughest warrior would give
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up after three days in that\Nthree-month-long course, let alone a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought the same
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:19:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing until I met that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Okun showed me something once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted To teach me something,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.61,0:19:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my dearest lady Lindberg, have\Na quick look at this flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tiny flame got bigger,\Ninteresting, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending upon the training\Nthat one has received,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even the base level skill tiny\Nflame can grow this large.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has no practical use, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for me who has lived 200 years\Nand has some time on his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a bit of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny flame,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried countless times\Nto do it myself too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't make the\Nflame even slightly larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not something that\Ncould be done in a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it requires devotion to your\Nstudies for a very long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's precisely why I was\Nso stunned. I couldn't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was many times bigger than what the\Nworld's greatest sorcerer Oaken had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tiny flame that outclassed\Nany I'd ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that this is my tiny flame,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.17,0:20:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my other five class\Nskills are exactly like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you\Nunderstand what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, all six of his\Nclass skills are extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I even bother showing off to\Nsuch a monumentally powerful person?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just some exaggerated,\Nhigh-level skills that I've only
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memorized?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He repelled those attacks from that\NMinotaur's axe with only a single
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,broadsword in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't brag about his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, in fact, he quietly went on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.23,0:20:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,working for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could put it into one\Nword, I'd say he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only in body, but in mind as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the fortitude to live\Nlife on his own, so he will
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never yield to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the future, I will be in the\Nposition to lead this kingdom alongside
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:21:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The motto of the Clay's royal family\Nis: Those of royal blood must be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why more than anything, I must\Nlearn how to achieve such strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lordnor, I have figured\Nout what you need of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll control my pride and my immaturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until the great day comes when you\Nwill recognize me as your page!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will follow behind\Nyou wherever you may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And learn everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.35,0:21:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to teach me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.93,0:21:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.11,0:21:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer that I am in pursuit of,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the supreme strength\Nthat the generations upon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,generations of the clay's\Nroyal family have sought,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.57,0:21:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resides within this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why is this happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.67,0:22:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that I have a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a dream that I can't see. I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.29,0:22:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.83,0:22:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.99,0:23:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

